</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He bids us build each other up;</l><l>And, gathered into one,</l><l>To our high calling’s glorious hope,</l><l>We hand in hand go on,</l><l>We hand in hand go on.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The gift which He on one bestows,</l><l>We all delight to prove;</l><l>The grace through every vessel flows,</l><l>In purest streams of love,</l><l>In purest streams of love.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We all partake the joy of one;</l><l>The common peace we feel;</l><l>A peace to worldly minds unknown,</l><l>A joy unspeakable,</l><l>A joy unspeakable.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>And if our fellowship below</l><l>In Christ yet be so sweet,</l><l>What height of rapture shall we know,</l><l>When round His throne we meet,</l><l>When round His throne we meet!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
